Part 2: Type Advantages
Requirements
Enhance the combat system by giving monsters types that adjust the damage they inflict. Depending on the attacking and defending types, damage may be increased or decreased.

Monster Types: Each monster now also has a type, such as Fire, Water, Grass, or Electric.

Type Effectiveness:

Certain type pairings cause double damage (2x).
Certain type pairings cause half damage (0.5x).
Any pairing not listed as special uses regular damage (1x).
Example Type Chart:

Fire -> Grass: 2x damage
Fire -> Water: 0.5x damage
Water -> Fire: 2x damage
Water -> Grass: 0.5x damage
Grass -> Water: 2x damage
Grass -> Fire: 0.5x damage
Electric -> Water: 2x damage
Every remaining pairing: 1x damage
Attack Order: Monsters continue to act by list position: the first living monster attacks the first living opposing monster.

